---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<rss version="2.0">
<channel>
    <title>Chance_Blog</title>
    <link>{{ '/' | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</link>
    <description>인공지능, 우주·로보틱스, 하드웨어와 기술 정책을 출처와 맥락을 바탕으로 분석합니다.</description>
    <language>ko</language>
    {% for post in site.posts %}
        <item>
            <title>{{ post.title | xml_escape }}</title>
            <link>{{ post.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">{{ post.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</guid>
            <pubDate>{{ post.date | date_to_rfc822 }}</pubDate>
            <description>{{ post.excerpt | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | xml_escape }}</description>
        </item>
    {% endfor %}
</channel>
</rss>
